<script type="module" src="@Assets["Components/Layout/ReconnectModal.razor.js"]"></script>
<dialog id="components-reconnect-modal" data-nosnippet>
    <div class="components-reconnect-container">
        <div class="components-rejoining-animation" aria-hidden="true"><div></div><div></div></div>
        <p class="components-reconnect-first-attempt-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Восстанавливаем соединение…</span><span class="locale-en">Reconnecting to the server…</span></p>
        <p class="components-reconnect-repeated-attempt-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Повторная попытка через </span><span class="locale-en">Retrying in </span><span id="components-seconds-to-next-attempt"></span><span class="locale-ru"> сек.</span><span class="locale-en"> seconds.</span></p>
        <p class="components-reconnect-failed-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Соединение потеряно. Попробуйте снова или перезагрузите страницу.</span><span class="locale-en">Connection lost. Please retry or reload the page.</span></p>
        <button id="components-reconnect-button" class="components-reconnect-failed-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Повторить</span><span class="locale-en">Retry</span></button>
        <p class="components-pause-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Сессия приостановлена сервером.</span><span class="locale-en">The session has been paused by the server.</span></p>
        <p class="components-resume-failed-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Не удалось восстановить сессию. Перезагрузите страницу.</span><span class="locale-en">Could not resume the session. Please reload the page.</span></p>
        <button id="components-resume-button" class="components-pause-visible components-resume-failed-visible"><span class="locale-ru">Продолжить</span><span class="locale-en">Resume</span></button>
    </div>
</dialog>